# Execution framework

Read docs/architecture/execution.md. Do the current Now step, run its pass check, then start Next in the same turn. Do not wait for "continue."

Do not remove a shipped screen, menu child, or command while continuing. If the next step needs an owner choice or a MAGI oracle change, stop.

Update Now / Next in execution.md after a gate is green, then begin Next.
